/Alt (An EUV photomask\054 or reticle\054 with its pellicle dust cover\056 The glass is 152\0564 mm square and 6\05635 mm thick\054 the size given in a 2016 Hoya patent\056 On the mask\054 the pattern is four times the size of the 26 by 33 mm area it prints on the wafer\056 The mirror coating is drawn far thicker than it is\056 The loupe shows a cut through the pattern and the mirror coating at true thickness\056)
